+<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+<title>Privacy Policy — Close Protection Ops</title>
+<style>
+  body { margin: 0; background: #0f1418; color: #e8e6e1; font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
+  main { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 60px; }
+  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
+  h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 28px 0 6px; color: #c9a96b; }
+  a { color: #c9a96b; }
+  .meta { color: #9aa0a6; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
+  ul { padding-left: 20px; }
+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<main>
+<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+<p class="meta">Close Protection Ops &mdash; last updated 20 September 2026</p>
+
+<h2>Who we are</h2>
+<p>Close Protection Ops (&ldquo;the App&rdquo;) is provided by RD Anzen Ltd, a company registered in England and Wales (company number 08957578).
+Contact: <a href="mailto:Rick@RDAnzen.co.uk">Rick@RDAnzen.co.uk</a>.</p>
+
+<h2>The short version</h2>
+<ul>
+  <li>The App has no accounts, no servers that receive your data, no analytics, no advertising and no tracking. It never sends what you enter to any server.</li>
+  <li>Everything you enter is stored only in your own browser, on your own device. RD Anzen Ltd cannot see it, recover it, or delete it for you.</li>
+  <li>Because you decide what to record about principals, team members, venues and visitors, <strong>you (or your organisation) are the data controller</strong> for that information, not RD Anzen Ltd.</li>
+</ul>
+
+<h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
+<p>The App uses your browser&rsquo;s local storage and a service worker (an offline cache of the App&rsquo;s own files) purely to make the App work and to let it run offline. They are not used to track you.
+What you enter &mdash; which may include names, phone numbers, addresses, routes, vehicle registrations, SIA licence details, visitor logs, travel document details, health information such as blood type, allergies, conditions and medications, and uploaded documents &mdash; stays on the device unless you export or share it yourself.</p>
+<p><strong>It is not encrypted.</strong> The optional PIN lock is a screen lock that deters casual access; it is not encryption and does not protect against someone with technical access to the device. Anyone who can use your browser profile may be able to read the data. Use your device&rsquo;s own security (passcode, full-disk encryption) and keep devices up to date.</p>
+
+<h2>Backups, exports and sharing</h2>
+<p>Export Data (JSON backup) and Export Document (Word) files are created on your device and are <strong>not encrypted</strong>. The Share option produces an encrypted file protected by a passphrase you choose; its strength depends entirely on that passphrase. Once a file leaves the App, keeping it secure is your responsibility.</p>
+
+<h2>Special category (health) information</h2>
+<p>Health information about a person is special category data under UK GDPR. If you record it, you need a lawful basis and an Article 9 condition (for example the person&rsquo;s explicit consent, or vital interests in an emergency), and only the information needed. RD Anzen Ltd does not receive or process it.</p>
+
+<h2>Hosting</h2>
+<p>The App is delivered as a static website by GitHub Pages. When your device loads the App, GitHub, as our hosting provider, receives standard technical information (such as your IP address and browser details) under its own privacy statement:
+<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub General Privacy Statement</a>.
+The App itself loads no third-party scripts, fonts or trackers.</p>
+
+<h2>Links to other sites</h2>
+<p>Some buttons open Google Maps, what3words or GOV.UK in a new tab. If you click one, the text in the link (for example an address, a three-word address or a country name) is sent to that site, which has its own privacy policy. Nothing is sent unless you click.</p>
+
+<h2>If you contact us</h2>
